<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on BNP.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on BNP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. New York has issued ten million American-style call warrants in two equal tranches, on BNP stock, lead manager Citibank S.A. said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   28.OCT.96	   LISTING	  PARIS</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1000		  SPOT REFERENCE  194.30 FRF</p>
<p>+  +  +  +  +  +</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE    MATURITY   PRICE     PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> CALL  A     220	 17.NOV.98  2.48 FRF  25.99 PCT 7.8 X</p>
<p> CALL  B     260	 17.NOV.00  2.86 FRF  48.53 PCT 6.8 X</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
